 "raw_input": "Dis · manibus · Zethi vixit · annis · VI\n\nDismanibusZethivixitannisVI\n\nText edited by Prag from photograph\n\nMommsen: vixit\n\nTo the shades of the underworld. (Memorial) of Zethus. He lived 6 years.",
 "tei_body": "<body><div type=\"edition\" subtype=\"primary\" xml:space=\"preserve\" xml:lang=\"la\" resp=\"#JP\" source=\"#JP\">\n                <ab>\n                    <lb n=\"1\"/><w n=\"5\">D<hi rend=\"tall\">i</hi>s</w> <g ref=\"#interpunct\" n=\"10\">·</g> <w n=\"15\"><expan><abbr>man</abbr><ex>ibus</ex></expan></w>\n                    <lb n=\"2\"/><g ref=\"#interpunct\" n=\"20\">·</g> <persName type=\"attested\"><name><w n=\"25\">Zet<hi rend=\"ligature\">hi</hi></w></name></persName>\n                    <lb n=\"3\"/><w n=\"30\"><expan><abbr>vix</abbr><ex>it</ex></expan></w> <g ref=\"#interpunct\" n=\"35\">·</g> <w n=\"40\"><expan><abbr>a</abbr><ex>nnis</ex></expan></w> <g ref=\"#interpunct\" n=\"45\">·</g> <num value=\"6\"><w n=\"50\">VI</w></num>\n                </ab>\n            </div><div type=\"edition\" subtype=\"simple-lemmatized\" resp=\"#RC\"><ab><w n=\"5\" lemma=\"Deus\">Dis</w><w n=\"15\" lemma=\"manes\">manibus</w><w n=\"25\" lemma=\"Zethus\">Zethi</w><w n=\"30\" lemma=\"vivo\">vixit</w><w n=\"40\" lemma=\"annus\">annis</w><w n=\"50\" lemma=\"VI\">VI</w></ab></div><div type=\"apparatus\" resp=\"#JP\"><listApp><app><note>Text edited by Prag from photograph</note></app><app loc=\"3\"><note>Mommsen: vixit</note></app></listApp></div><div type=\"translation\" xml:lang=\"en\" resp=\"#JP\"><p>To the shades of the underworld. (Memorial) of Zethus. He lived 6 years.</p></div><div type=\"commentary\"><p/></div><div type=\"bibliography\"><listBibl type=\"edition\"><bibl><author>Castelli</author><date>1784</date><citedRange>cl. 14 no. 147</citedRange><ptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/7PSFHSUH\"/><ref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002083\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002083</ref></bibl><bibl type=\"corpus\" n=\"CIL\"><author>Mommsen</author><date>1883</date><citedRange><ref target=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/books/CILv10pII1883\">7190</ref></citedRange><ptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/GQN8UZSI\"/><ref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</ref></bibl><bibl type=\"corpus\" n=\"ILMusPalermo\"><author>Bivona</author><date>1970</date><citedRange>1</citedRange><ptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/FZWWPUD6\"/><ref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002142\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002142</ref></bibl><bibl/></listBibl><listBibl type=\"discussion\"><bibl/></listBibl></div></body>",
 "tei_header": "<teiHeader>\n  <fileDesc>\n    <titleStmt>\n      <title>Funerary inscription of Zethus</title>\n      <editor ref=\"#JP\">Jonathan Prag</editor>\n      <principal ref=\"#JP\">Jonathan Prag</principal>\n      <funder>John Fell OUP Research Fund</funder>\n      <funder>\n        <ref target=\"https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/885040\">ERC Advanced Grant no.885040</ref>\n      </funder>\n      <respStmt>\n        <name xml:id=\"JP\" ref=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</name>\n        <resp>original data collection and editing</resp>\n      </respStmt>\n      <respStmt>\n        <name xml:id=\"JCu\" ref=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6686-3728\">James Cummings</name>\n        <resp>conversion to EpiDoc</resp>\n      </respStmt>\n      <respStmt>\n        <name xml:id=\"SS\" ref=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3914-9569\">Simona Stoyanova</name>\n        <resp>standardisation of template and tidying up encoding</resp>\n      </respStmt>\n      <respStmt>\n        <name xml:id=\"RC\" ref=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0100-7437\">Robert Crellin</name>\n        <resp>Lemmatization</resp>\n      </respStmt>\n      <respStmt>\n        <name xml:id=\"Coccato\" ref=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6641-2820\">Alessia Coccato</name>\n        <resp>Petrographic observation and analysis</resp>\n      </respStmt>\n    </titleStmt>\n    <publicationStmt>\n      <authority>I.Sicily</authority>\n      <idno type=\"filename\">ISic000001</idno>\n      <idno type=\"TM\">491696</idno>\n      <idno type=\"EDR\"/>\n      <idno type=\"EDH\"/>\n      <idno type=\"EDCS\">21900531</idno>\n      <idno type=\"PHI\"/>\n      <idno type=\"URI\">http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000001</idno>\n      <idno type=\"DOI\" when=\"2020-12-17\">10.5281/zenodo.4333721</idno>\n      <availability>\n        <licence target=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\">Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence</licence>\n      </availability>\n    </publicationStmt>\n    <sourceDesc>\n      <msDesc>\n        <msIdentifier>\n          <country>Italy</country>\n          <region>Sicily</region>\n          <settlement>Palermo</settlement>\n          <repository role=\"museum\" ref=\"http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/museum/064\">Museo Archeologico Regionale Antonino Salinas</repository>\n          <idno type=\"inventory\">3501</idno>\n          <altIdentifier>\n            <settlement/>\n            <repository/>\n            <idno type=\"old\"/>\n          </altIdentifier>\n        </msIdentifier>\n        <msContents>\n          <textLang mainLang=\"la\">Latin</textLang>\n        </msContents>\n        <physDesc>\n          <objectDesc>\n            <supportDesc>\n              <support>\n                <p>Marble plaque, employed as cover of a small sarcophagus</p>\n                <material ana=\"#material.inorganic.stone.metamorphic_rock.marble\" type=\"stone.marble\" subtype=\"unspecified\" resp=\"#Coccato\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/48.html\">marble</material>\n                <objectType ana=\"#object.plaque\" ref=\"https://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/objtyp/lod/259.html\">plaque</objectType>\n                <dimensions>\n                  <!--from ILPalermo-->\n                  <height unit=\"cm\">17.5</height>\n                  <width unit=\"cm\">29.3</width>\n                  <depth unit=\"cm\">1.5-2</depth>\n                </dimensions>\n              </support>\n              <condition ana=\"#condition.complete\"/>\n            </supportDesc>\n            <layoutDesc>\n              <layout>\n                <p>Three lines, roughly centered, but not perfectly perpendicular to the stone</p>\n                <rs ana=\"#execution.chiselled\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1\">chiselled</rs>\n                <damage ana=\"#text_condition.complete\"/>\n              </layout>\n            </layoutDesc>\n          </objectDesc>\n          <handDesc>\n            <handNote>\n              <!--ILPalermo-->\n              <locus from=\"line1\" to=\"line1\">Line 1</locus>\n              <dimensions type=\"letterHeight\">\n                <height unit=\"mm\" atLeast=\"32\" atMost=\"35\">32-35</height>\n              </dimensions>\n              <locus from=\"line2\" to=\"line2\">Line 2</locus>\n              <dimensions type=\"letterHeight\">\n                <height unit=\"mm\" atLeast=\"35\" atMost=\"35\">35</height>\n              </dimensions>\n              <locus from=\"line3\" to=\"line3\">Line 3</locus>\n              <dimensions type=\"letterHeight\">\n                <height unit=\"mm\" atLeast=\"30\" atMost=\"32\">30-32</height>\n              </dimensions>\n              <locus from=\"line1\" to=\"line2\">Interlineation line 1 to 2</locus>\n              <dimensions type=\"interlinear\">\n                <height unit=\"mm\"/>\n              </dimensions>\n            </handNote>\n          </handDesc>\n        </physDesc>\n        <history>\n          <origin>\n            <origPlace>\n              <region>Sicilia</region>\n              <placeName type=\"ancient\"/>\n              <placeName type=\"modern\" ref=\"http://sws.geonames.org/2525448\">Caltanissetta</placeName>\n              <geo>37.49025, 14.06216</geo>\n            </origPlace>\n            <origDate datingMethod=\"#julian\" notBefore-custom=\"0051\" notAfter-custom=\"0300\" evidence=\"lettering textual-context\">between later 1st and 3rd century CE</origDate>\n          </origin>\n          <provenance type=\"found\" subtype=\"discovered\" when=\"1782\">Found in 'feudo Landri di Placido Notarbartolo duca di Villarosa', in the territory of Caltanissetta in 1782; now on display on the first floor of the Palermo Museum.</provenance>\n          <provenance type=\"observed\" subtype=\"autopsied\">Observed and photographed 2025</provenance>\n          <acquisition/>\n        </history>\n      </msDesc>\n    </sourceDesc>\n  </fileDesc>\n  <encodingDe